WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.887
Week 2: Greetings and First Contact. greet and take leave introduce yourself and another person choose tú or usted

2
00:00:07.887 --> 00:00:14.239
Mission brief. Handle a first meeting twice: once with a peer and once in a formal setting.

3
00:00:14.239 --> 00:00:23.643
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:23.643 --> 00:00:31.424
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:31.424 --> 00:00:39.951
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:39.951 --> 00:01:09.260
Model language. Voy a presentarme dos veces. — I am going to introduce myself twice. Practico el registro formal primero. — I practice the formal register first. Grabo mi presentación informal después. — I record my informal introduction afterward. Repito la parte que salió mal. — I repeat the part that went wrong. Corrijo el tono para mejorar la próxima vez. — I correct the tone to improve next time.

7
00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:19.158
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
